# Keep secrets and local build output out of the Docker build context.
# apps/api/.env holds the real API key locally; it must never reach an image or its build layers.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Local build output (Windows paths in obj/ can break a Linux restore).
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Editor and OS files.
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
